<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed business index 5.7 in April.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed business index 5.7 in April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia on Thursday said its index of business activity in the manufacturing sector fell to 5.7 in April from 21.1 in March.</p>
<p>			    April   Drop   Unch   Rise   March</p>
<p>Business Conditions     5.7   18.9   56.0   24.6    21.1</p>
<p>New orders		 10.5   18.7   51.2   29.1    18.8</p>
<p>Shipments		  19.0   13.6   53.8   32.6    23.9</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 5.3   24.3   56.7   19.0   - 7.7</p>
<p>Delivery time	   - 9.0   15.0   79.0    6.0   - 3.1</p>
<p>Inventories	     - 5.2   25.4   54.1   20.2   -11.1</p>
<p>Prices paid		19.9    2.8   73.2   22.7    13.3</p>
<p>Prices received	 - 1.8   11.6   78.5    9.8   - 2.4</p>
<p>Number of employees     4.1   11.4   71.1   15.5    10.5</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660 ))</p>
</text>
